_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vergoboy/vegord/zipball/v1.6.11","body":"## Vegcord 1.6.11\n\n### GFW proxy – stability & latency\n- Trimmed the DoH server list to resolvers that actually answer on filtered lines (8 reachable endpoints).\n- Added a switch-margin + longer rescan interval so the proxy stops flipping between ~300ms DoH servers and churning the DNS cache.\n- Faster DoH/relay handshake failover; the 120s voice timeout now only applies to port 50001, not regular 443 traffic.\n\n### Discord connectivity\n- Discord IP routing now prefers the lowest-RTT server instead of a random order.\n- Removed the sub-1ms \"interception\" filter that discarded the working local Cloudflare PoP IPs (they're genuine here — real traffic flows through them).\n\n### Message bubbles\n- Fixed Discord's cozy left-padding (`--custom-message-margin-left-content-cozy`, ~60px) inflating the wrong box; content now starts at the bubble edge without touching any margins.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vergoboy/vegord/releases/363716865","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vergoboy/vegord/releases/363716865/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/vergoboy/vegord/releases/363716865/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/vergoboy/vegord/releases/tag/v1.6.7","id":363716865,"author":{"login":"vergoboy","id":91977047,"node_id":"U_kgDOBXt1Vw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91977047?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vergoboy","html_url":"https://github.com/vergoboy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vergoboy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vergoboy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vergoboy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vergoboy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vergoboy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vergoboy/orgs","repos_url":"