gord 1.6.7 (Windows)\n\n## Fixes\n- **Vegord Vencord toolbar + rebrand now load on Windows**: the bundled custom Vencord build with the `vegordToolbox` plugin is detected correctly. Previous Windows builds silently fell back to stock upstream Vencord because `fs.promises.access()` fails on directories inside `app.asar` (fixed by using `existsSync`).\n- **GFW proxy always runs on Windows**: hardened proxy startup — `python` fallback for the Python proxy script, and stale-port cleanup via `netstat -ano` / `taskkill /F /T`.\n- Screen share quality selection and default-audio fixes.\n\n## Downloads\n- Installer: `Vegcord-Setup-1.6.7.exe` (NSIS, x64 + arm64)\n- Portable zips: `Vegcord-1.6.7-win.zip` (x64), `Vegcord-1.6.7-arm64-win.zip`\n"}]